# ============================================================
# Random Forest Regression - Overpotential
# Separate P/A or Ratio dataset
#
# Validation:
# - Nested Grouped Cross-Validation
# - Outer 5-fold + Inner 3-fold
# - Literature-grouped splitting by Reference
# - Univariate hyperparameter tuning in inner CV
# - Pooled OOF evaluation
# - Literature-level bootstrap 95% CI
#
# Final model:
# - Full-data 3-fold literature-grouped tuning
# - Refit on 100% data with selected hyperparameter
# - SHAP analysis
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - P/A and Ratio are separate datasets.
# - Set DATASET_TYPE = "PA" or "RATIO".
# - Random Forest does NOT use feature scaling.
# - Categorical encoding is fitted inside each training fold.
# ============================================================

